# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000583> (has measurement datum)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000583> "relates a time stamped measurement datum to the measurement datum that was measured"@en)
