AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000003> "measurement unit label"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000003> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000009>)

